        1739,
        1758,
        2138
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In accordance with Section 117b (2) of the New York City Charter the itemized information in the aforementioned supporting schedules of the Mayor's Message have included modifications to March 15th. Subsequent actions, in accordance with the provisions of the New York City Charter, approving modifications are hereby carried over effective July 1, 1964. Further actions in accordance with provisions of the New York City Charter approving modifications which adjusted the rates of positions reallocated as of January 1, 1964, are also incorporated in the aforementioned supporting schedules, effective July 1.",
